  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Caution",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Venerable placements come from fan sources rather than a pinned chapter. Sources disagree on Early Antiquity Era versus Late Antiquity Era before the present age. This page states nothing about where the regional walls come from.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources do not agree on the name of the age immediately before the present age.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Demon Venerable is a rank nine demonic path Gu Master. An Immortal Venerable is a rank nine righteous Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The difference is one of ideals that has been debated without a settled winner.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "How demonic path and righteous path differ in practice.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-and-righteous-path-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The demonic path acts freely and the righteous path binds itself to rules and customs that distribute benefits inside a force; a demonic path cultivator is a lone individual who takes cultivation resources without that restraint.",
      "chapters": [
        1223
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-and-righteous-path-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtaining Red Lotus Demon Venerable’s inheritance clues.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "red-lotus-inheritance-trails",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtains Red Lotus Demon Venerable’s inheritance clues, including a time path inheritance that requires Spring Autumn Cicada.",
      "chapters": [
        830
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "red-lotus-inheritance-trails",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reckless Savage named among Olden’s Demon Venerables, and learning from the icy plain.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reckless-savages-icy-plain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recognises Reckless Savage Demon Venerable as one of the three Demon Venerables of the Olden Antiquity Era. He is named progenitor of strength path and creator of transformation path.",
      "chapters": [
        597
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reckless-savages-icy-plain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "True meaning left in the icy plain enters the cultivator who breaks its outer forms, and that is treated as learning from Reckless Savage Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reckless-savages-icy-plain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless Demon Venerable in an immortal zombie inheritance discussion.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-in-an-inheritance-note",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless Demon Venerable surfaces when an immortal zombie inheritance discussion credits his rule path achievements and an inheritance tied to his name.",
      "chapters": [
        937
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-in-an-inheritance-note",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Which paths Limitless and Reckless Savage created, and their placement in this era.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-in-olden-antiquity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Olden Antiquity Era, Limitless Demon Venerable created rule path, and Reckless Savage Demon Venerable created transformation path.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-in-olden-antiquity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan accepting Red Lotus’s true inheritance on a stone lotus island.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stone-lotus-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_red_lotus_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On a stone lotus island Red Lotus’ true meaning tells Fang Yuan to accept the true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stone-lotus-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless’s Olden attack on Heavenly Court and the chess arrangement that outlives him.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pavilion-arrangement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Olden Antiquity Era a million years ago, Limitless Demon Venerable attacked Heavenly Court and arranged a chess game with Star Constellation’s will inside Imperfection Regret Pavilion. After he leaves, Heavenly Court Gu Immortals can at times still see two vague figures inside the pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pavilion-arrangement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperfection_regret_pavilion",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Red Lotus as creator of Spring Autumn Cicada.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spring-autumn-cicada",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long tells Hong Ting that Hong Ting created Spring Autumn Cicada and can rebirth.",
      "chapters": [
        1747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spring-autumn-cicada",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spring Autumn Cicada was refined by Duke Long’s disciple, Red Lotus Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        1918
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spring-autumn-cicada",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Who the three are in order, and how far back Olden Antiquity sits.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster-and-span",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless was a Venerable from a million years ago during the Olden Antiquity Era, and Reckless Savage and Red Lotus came after him.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster-and-span",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The present story’s return to that pavilion game.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chess-game-in-the-present",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silhouettes of Limitless Demon Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable are still playing that game inside Imperfection Regret Pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chess-game-in-the-present",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The list of the ten Venerables by era.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Across the ten Venerables listed by era, all three sit under Olden Antiquity at one million years ago: Limitless Demon Venerable, Reckless Savage Demon Venerable, and Red Lotus Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless named as humanity’s first Demon Venerable in that succession.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless Demon Venerable is humanity’s first Demon Venerable, attacking Heavenly Court in the Olden Antiquity Era a million years ago.",
      "chapters": [
        2086
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
